### Case: write-unknown-key — each write method with a key no app has.
### Expect 401 "Invalid API key in request" from all three. This is also what a
### switched-off partner sees.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/items
X-Api-Key: 00000000-not-a-real-key
content-type: application/json

{"title":"Trail running shoe","price":89.5}

###
PUT {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/items/1
X-Api-Key: 00000000-not-a-real-key
content-type: application/json

{"id":1,"title":"Trail running shoe","price":79.5}

###
DELETE {{GATEWAY}}/catalog/items/1
X-Api-Key: 00000000-not-a-real-key
